## VS Code — based on https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/VisualStudioCode.gitignore
## Shared workspace config (settings, tasks, launch, extensions) stays tracked.

.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets

# Local History for Visual Studio Code
.history/

# Built Visual Studio Code Extensions
*.vsix


## Visual Studio — from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore

# Cache, options and per-user settings
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# Reports and backups left by Visual Studio's project upgrade wizard
/Backup*/
UpgradeLog*.htm
UpgradeLog*.XML


## Claude Code
## Shared config (CLAUDE.md, .claude/settings.json) stays tracked; personal files don't.

**/.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Git worktrees Claude Code creates for sessions
.claude/worktrees/


## SQLite
## The movie database is built locally from the CSV and never committed.

*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
